# MEDSURE Frontend Environment Variables

# 1. Direct Client API Connection (Recommended for Vercel)
# Point this to your hosted backend (on Render, Railway, Fly.io, Koyeb, AWS, etc.)
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-medsure-backend.onrender.com/api/v1

# 2. Server-side Proxy Rewrites (Optional Alternative)
# If set in Vercel environment variables, Next.js server rewrites /api/v1/* requests
# to this backend URL, eliminating browser CORS and Mixed Content issues entirely.
# BACKEND_URL=https://your-medsure-backend.onrender.com
